{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34371","headline":"春雨即事寄袭美 · 陆龟蒙","name":"春雨即事寄袭美","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小谢轻埃日日飞，城边江上阻春晖。\n虽愁野岸花房冻，还得山家药笋肥。\n双屐着频看齿折，败裘披苦见毛稀。\n比邻钓叟无尘事，洒笠鸣蓑夜半归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}